==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
For an early-game to mid-game player, bring [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] and [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] Cats; anti-Reds are effective against all the enemies, and anti-Floating units are useful against [[J.K. Bun Bun|J.K. Bun Bun]]. A prime example is [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]], who can almost immobilize Bun Bun's advance with his slow, or [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] who can perma-freeze him with two or more of them desynced.

